You are a senior Laravel architect, EdTech product designer, software architect, AI systems engineer, knowledge management expert, and UI/UX engineer.

Your task is to design and implement a production-ready **AcadFlow Knowledge Hub**.

IMPORTANT

Before writing any code:

- Thoroughly inspect the existing AcadFlow codebase.
- Identify features that already exist.
- Reuse existing models, controllers, services, repositories, policies, jobs, notifications, media library, AI services, payment services, subscriptions, wallets, discussions, comments, user profiles, permissions, search, categories, tags, and analytics.
- Do NOT duplicate functionality.
- Do NOT create duplicate routes, controllers, models, migrations, settings, APIs, or services.
- Extend the current architecture wherever possible.
- Ensure every feature integrates seamlessly with the existing AcadFlow ecosystem.

=========================================================
PROJECT VISION
=========================================================

AcadFlow Knowledge Hub is NOT a blog.

It is a professional academic publishing and knowledge-sharing platform where:

- Students share knowledge
- Lecturers publish expertise
- Researchers publish insights
- Departments publish updates
- Universities showcase research
- Educational resources become discoverable
- Creators build academic reputation
- Users can monetize quality educational content

The vision is:

"Learn. Share. Build Reputation. Earn."

